e across quarters. Where the filing gives no three-month EPS (fourth quarters), it is calculated as net income to common ÷ estimated diluted shares (the full-year weighted average × 4 less the nine-month average × 3), and may differ from the reported figure by a cent or two.","Debt = long-term debt including the current portion; excludes leases.","Other operating expenses = gross profit − operating income − the expense lines shown.","Interest & other, net = pre-tax income − operating income. Percentages are of revenue; figures may not sum due to rounding. QoQ compares with Q2 2026; YoY with Q3 2025."]}]}